WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.604 --> 00:00:16.108
The bus driver saw the monkey and slammed on the brakes.

2
00:00:16.128 --> 00:00:20.069
"Whoa!" he cried as the bus skidded.

3
00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:24.631
Crunch! The monkey struck the bus with his iron bar.

4
00:00:25.671 --> 00:00:28.972
The bus crashed into several trash cans, and the monkey stomped toward it.

5
00:00:30.348 --> 00:00:32.569
Passengers screamed as they scrambled off the bus.

6
00:00:32.589 --> 00:00:36.190
"Beware of the monkey!"

7
00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:40.211
"Run for your lives!"

8
00:00:43.452 --> 00:00:44.812
Bam! Crunch!

9
00:00:45.532 --> 00:00:48.173
The monkey struck the bus over and over again.

10
00:00:48.193 --> 00:00:51.994
"Stop right there!"

11
00:00:52.314 --> 00:00:55.835
Roxy flew toward the monkey, who spun around and hit her with the bar.

12
00:00:59.044 --> 00:00:59.304
Wham! "Ouch!"

13
00:00:59.324 --> 00:01:00.625
Roxy cried, rubbing her arm.

14
00:01:01.865 --> 00:01:03.846
The monkey's mouth dropped open in surprise.

15
00:01:03.866 --> 00:01:07.848
"My iron bar didn't destroy you!"

16
00:01:07.868 --> 00:01:10.569
"Of course it didn't!"

17
00:01:11.049 --> 00:01:12.169
Roxy said, annoyed.

18
00:01:12.189 --> 00:01:17.732
"Grr!" The monkey growled and swung the bar again and again.

19
00:01:18.652 --> 00:01:20.893
Each time Roxy managed to block it with her arm.

20
00:01:22.393 --> 00:01:23.614
Finally the monkey stopped.

21
00:01:23.634 --> 00:01:28.176
"I don't understand what's happening—my iron bar is a treasure from Heaven.

22
00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:30.609
It usually destroys demons."

23
00:01:32.790 --> 00:01:36.512
"I'm not a demon—I'm Rocket Girl," Roxy said.

24
00:01:37.833 --> 00:01:39.414
The monkey twirled the bar in the air.

25
00:01:39.434 --> 00:01:43.656
"Well, I'm Sun Wukong, king of the Fruit and Flower Mountain.

26
00:01:44.577 --> 00:01:47.178
I once defeated Heaven's entire army."

27
00:01:48.439 --> 00:01:50.380
Roxy raised an eyebrow, confused.

28
00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:55.143
"Huh?" Wukong didn't reply as he swung his iron bar again.

29
00:01:57.836 --> 00:01:59.617
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

30
00:02:01.239 --> 00:02:03.100
They bounced off the bar and hit a mailbox.

31
00:02:04.061 --> 00:02:05.922
Boom! "Oops!"

32
00:02:06.322 --> 00:02:06.923
Roxy said.

33
00:02:08.144 --> 00:02:11.046
As Wukong leaped toward Roxy, she jumped out of the way.

34
00:02:12.487 --> 00:02:17.551
Whiz-hoo! She struck Wukong's foot with her eye laser beams.

35
00:02:17.571 --> 00:02:20.313
"Yikes!" Wukong hopped on his other foot.

36
00:02:21.694 --> 00:02:23.855
"What are you doing in Metro City anyway?"

37
00:02:24.155 --> 00:02:24.816
Roxy asked.

38
00:02:26.396 --> 00:02:30.378
"I'm looking for my friend," Wukong said, swinging his iron bar.

39
00:02:32.279 --> 00:02:35.301
Bam! A big streetlight crashed into Wukong.

40
00:02:35.321 --> 00:02:37.762
"Got you!"

41
00:02:38.042 --> 00:02:39.943
Roxy said, brushing dust off her hands.

42
00:02:41.364 --> 00:02:42.525
Wukong rubbed his head.

43
00:02:43.445 --> 00:02:45.126
He saw a smashed delivery van.

44
00:02:47.688 --> 00:02:51.650
A big grin spread across his face as he picked it up and hurled it at Roxy.

45
00:02:53.311 --> 00:02:55.432
"Oof!" Roxy barely caught it.

46
00:02:57.544 --> 00:02:59.105
"See how strong I am?"

47
00:02:59.425 --> 00:03:00.325
Wukong boasted.

48
00:03:00.345 --> 00:03:02.366
"Big deal!"

49
00:03:02.686 --> 00:03:04.187
Roxy said as she put the van down.

50
00:03:04.207 --> 00:03:08.409
"I'm super strong too!"

51
00:03:09.329 --> 00:03:10.890
Roxy picked up the smashed bus.

52
00:03:11.630 --> 00:03:13.511
With a grunt, she threw it at Wukong.

53
00:03:14.291 --> 00:03:15.772
The bus landed on Wukong.

54
00:03:15.792 --> 00:03:18.073
"Got you again!"

55
00:03:18.553 --> 00:03:19.253
Roxy cried.

56
00:03:20.754 --> 00:03:22.375
Suddenly the bus began to rise.

57
00:03:23.435 --> 00:03:25.476
Wukong tossed it aside and shrugged.

58
00:03:26.408 --> 00:03:29.349
"So we're both strong, but you should still surrender now.

59
00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:33.111
I have powers that you wouldn't believe."

60
00:03:33.131 --> 00:03:35.532
"Oh yeah?"

61
00:03:37.473 --> 00:03:38.613
Roxy took a deep breath.

62
00:03:39.293 --> 00:03:43.395
Whoo-oo-oosh! Her superbreath rushed toward Wukong.

63
00:03:43.855 --> 00:03:48.397
The monkey tumbled backward and slammed into a building.

64
00:03:50.098 --> 00:03:52.119
Wukong stood up and dusted himself off.

65
00:03:53.299 --> 00:03:55.140
Laughing, he walked back to Roxy.

66
00:03:57.117 --> 00:04:01.178
"Until now, I thought you were just some silly little demon.

67
00:04:01.979 --> 00:04:04.860
Now I realize I'm going to need some of my super powers."

68
00:04:04.880 --> 00:04:09.422
"Go ahead and try that, Monkey," Roxy said with a shrug.

69
00:04:09.442 --> 00:04:13.163
"I don't think anyone has more super powers than I do.

70
00:04:13.904 --> 00:04:17.805
In fact, I'm probably the most powerful person in the world!"

71
00:04:19.146 --> 00:04:20.226
Wukong gasped.

72
00:04:20.947 --> 00:04:23.368
"It—it's you!"

73
00:04:24.756 --> 00:04:25.537
Roxy frowned.

74
00:04:25.557 --> 00:04:27.460
"What are you talking about?"

75
00:04:27.480 --> 00:04:31.445
"You're the goddess Swift Wing told me about."

76
00:04:31.865 --> 00:04:34.509
Wukong said, his eyes blazing with anger.

77
00:04:34.529 --> 00:04:39.695
"She said you were going to help the Demon of Black Rain destroy me!"
